r\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T09:41:17-07:00","id":1129272,"title":"","content":"Ok, all the Slashers are done, I added paragraphs following LostLight's suggestions and, as I tend to do when I want to have fun, I hid some easter eggs and silly symbolism all over the place.<br /> <br /> I really needed to distract myself and write something easy but fun. I think that, for what I aimed for, the result is decent. Hammy and dumb, but decent. Taking everything out, it's still some ready-made scary slashers which can be used as needed. That said, I do hope you enjoy the final result as a whole as well.<br /> <br /> Another pitch from my list made into reality, let's cross that out and move forward. 'Till next time, people!<br /> <br /> (Obviously, criticism, ideas and comments are welcomed as usual. For example, I'd like to know what your favorite slasher is, if any)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target